# Generated by site/scripts/generate-skill-docs.mjs from the real sources in
# core/skills/ and profiles/*/skills/. The generator rmSync's this whole
# directory and rebuilds it from scratch before every `build`, `dev` and
# `start` -- including the deploy in .github/workflows/docs.yml -- so the
# committed copy was never read, only overwritten.
#
# It was tracked until 1.14.x, and had drifted to 101 missing pages, 3 stale
# ones and a skill deleted upstream but still present here. Nothing failed,
# because nothing consumes it: the published site regenerates at deploy time
# and was always correct. Untracking it is what makes that drift impossible
# rather than merely unnoticed.
site/src/content/docs/skills/
